\frac{\partial\varepsilon}{\partial t}+\mathbf{u}\cdot\nabla\varepsilon & =\nabla\cdot\frac{\nu_{t}}{\sigma_{\varepsilon}}\nabla\varepsilon & + & \frac{\varepsilon}{k}c_{1\varepsilon}S_{k} & + & c_{3g}\frac{\varepsilon}{k}\max\left(B_{k},0\right) & -\frac{\varepsilon}{k} & c_{2}\varepsilon
